stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unknown

    Unknown --> MessageReceived: MESSAGE received directly
    MessageReceived --> MessageAccepted: structurally valid<br>and group visible
    MessageReceived --> MessageIgnored: group not visible
    MessageReceived --> SessionFailed: malformed record

    MessageAccepted --> MessageStored: new message stored
    MessageAccepted --> DuplicateKnown: message already present

    MessageStored --> AckEligible: ACK flag set
    DuplicateKnown --> AckEligible: seen and ACK flags set

    AckEligible --> WaitingForReverseStream: incoming simplex stream<br>cannot carry the ACK

    WaitingForReverseStream --> AckQueued: reverse-direction outgoing<br>session started, ACK selected
    AckQueued --> Acknowledged: ACK written to<br>reverse-direction stream
    AckQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed

    WaitingForReverseStream --> MessageReceived: duplicate MESSAGE received<br>before ACK is sent

    Acknowledged --> [*]
    MessageIgnored --> [*]
    SessionFailed --> [*]